# --- large source data ---
# The raw OSM extract (~211 MB) exceeds GitHub's 100 MB file limit and is only
# needed to REBUILD the dataset, not to run the app, so it is not committed.
# Run `python pipeline/download_pbf.py` to fetch it locally when rebuilding.
